            {
                "entry_id": "8c6ca2b1-5541-3e4f-9753-75fe5dce5cc8",
                "word": "chanterelle",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cd691ef8-98f0-43bd-89c7-b8e083955050",
                        "entry_id": "8c6ca2b1-5541-3e4f-9753-75fe5dce5cc8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chanterelles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0666ec29-8b02-3d3d-b3ab-be49b5f2f679",
                        "entry_id": "8c6ca2b1-5541-3e4f-9753-75fe5dce5cc8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A widely distributed edible mushroom, Cantharellus cibarius, being yellow and trumpet-shaped; or any similar mushroom of the genera Cantharellus, Polyozellus or Gomphus, not all of which are edible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c067393d-aa1b-44de-9896-e732a3c48dd3",
                                "sense_id": "0666ec29-8b02-3d3d-b3ab-be49b5f2f679",
                                "text": "Even the homely wood blewits, that you cook like tripe, with milk and onions, and the egg-yolk yellow chanterelle with its fan-vaulting and faint smell of apricots, all spring up overnight like bubbles of earth, unsustained by nature, existing in a void."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bda8136e-ad2c-320d-9d3b-6d930664f938",
                        "entry_id": "8c6ca2b1-5541-3e4f-9753-75fe5dce5cc8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The highest string of the violin or similar instrument."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0768f14f-c155-4399-8752-a2cd14f45c6a",
                                "sense_id": "bda8136e-ad2c-320d-9d3b-6d930664f938",
                                "text": "There were hushed moments of complete beauty when the melody moved out and hung above the chanterelle like a hummingbird poised over a flower."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6bcb1872-9be1-4e31-923d-42ba8b9f308b",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c6ca2b1-5541-3e4f-9753-75fe5dce5cc8",
                        "source_sense_description": "Cantharellus cibarius",
                        "target_lang_word": "liška obecná",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "liška obecná",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a8e1d74-e1a0-36f4-a393-77c32ea5fad6",
                                        "entry_id": "c2e60213-9a42-31c3-87fe-26dc3cff93f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "druh psovité šelmy (Vulpes vulpes)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49a74fb6-3511-48ae-a2d3-4d6639ae1f77",
                                                "sense_id": "5a8e1d74-e1a0-36f4-a393-77c32ea5fad6",
                                                "text": "Nejběžnější šelmou, která přichází se srnčí zvěří do styku, je liška obecná."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee2f483d-4b15-34c8-bfdb-546f3cf23775",
                                        "entry_id": "c2e60213-9a42-31c3-87fe-26dc3cff93f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "druh stopkovýtrusých hub (Cantharellus cibarius)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3bb4c15-3741-4831-975c-850738f80e44",
                                                "sense_id": "ee2f483d-4b15-34c8-bfdb-546f3cf23775",
                                                "text": "Z jedlých hub je to především hřib obecný smrkový a liška obecná, které skýtají hlavní surovinu houbařskému konservárenskému průmyslu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
